   G("Tempest Bell", ["Magnified Area II", "Overabundance I", "Close Combat I"], L("Sino que os golpes explodem", "Bell your hits detonate"), L("Magnified Area II (tier 3): mais área.", "Magnified Area II (tier 3): more area.")),
