 dict(id="wave", name=L("Waystones 80+", "Waystones 80+"), lv=[80, 89], tag=L("A árvore de ES: Chaos Inoculation e o equipamento rare", "The ES tree: Chaos Inoculation and the rare gear"),
  carry=L("Você: Storm Wave (Tempest Flurry + Bell só no boss)", "You: Storm Wave (Tempest Flurry + Bell on bosses only)"), dmgSplit=[100, 0],
  goal=L("É a variante Waystones / 85+ Wave do autor: a versão de mapa com equipamento rare que o autor mais recomenda para começar a liga. A árvore vira de ES: entra Chaos Inoculation (vida máxima 1 e imunidade a caos), Melding (+40% de ES máximo) e First Principle of the Hollow (+20% de Evasion e de ES). Toda a defesa é a barra de ES e a Evasion. Corpo: 1400–1500 de Evasion e uns 500 de ES para não derrubar o crítico do Hollow Palm (cada 10 de ES nas peças dá +0,1% de chance de crítico); capacete com o máximo de ES (de preferência 500). Peça 'faster start of Energy Shield Recharge' e 'Energy Shield Recharge' onde puder. Cinto: Shavronne's Satchel + um Life Flask com recuperação INSTANTÂNEA (para recuperar ES ao usar o flask). Instill no amuleto: Subterfuge Mask (mais Evasion, com capacete de 400–500 de ES); se quiser dano, Stormcharged, Overwhelming Strike ou Deep Trance. Skills: Storm Wave com Deliberation (se a lentidão incomoda, troque por Rigwald's Ferocity) para limpar; Tempest Flurry + Tempest Bell SÓ contra boss. Spirit: Wind Dancer 30 + Herald of Ash 30 + Ghost Dance 30 = 90 dos 100; o Herald of Thunder e o Lingering Illusion saem. É um respec grande (~26 pontos saem e ~43 entram em relação à árvore anterior): faça quando o equipamento estiver pronto.",
         "This is the author's Waystones / 85+ Wave variant: the mapping version with the rare gear the author most recommends for starting the league. The tree becomes an ES tree: Chaos Inoculation comes in (maximum life 1 and chaos immunity), Melding (+40% maximum ES) and First Principle of the Hollow (+20% Evasion and ES). All your defence is the ES bar and Evasion. Body: 1400–1500 Evasion and about 500 ES so it doesn't drag down Hollow Palm's crit (every 10 ES on your pieces gives +0.1% crit chance); helmet with as much ES as possible (500 ideally). Get 'faster start of Energy Shield Recharge' and 'Energy Shield Recharge' wherever you can. Belt: Shavronne's Satchel + a Life Flask with INSTANT recovery (so using the flask recovers ES). Amulet instill: Subterfuge Mask (more Evasion, with a 400–500 ES helmet); for damage, Stormcharged, Overwhelming Strike or Deep Trance. Skills: Storm Wave with Deliberation (if the slowness bothers you, swap for Rigwald's Ferocity) to clear; Tempest Flurry + Tempest Bell ONLY against bosses. Spirit: Wind Dancer 30 + Herald of Ash 30 + Ghost Dance 30 = 90 of 100; Herald of Thunder and Lingering Illusion leave. It's a big respec (~26 points out and ~43 in versus the previous tree): do it when the gear is ready."),
  rotation=[L("Storm Wave nos packs (segurando o botão)", "Storm Wave on packs (holding the button)"), L("Boss: Tempest Bell até o Combo máximo, solte o sino e bata com o Tempest Flurry", "Boss: Tempest Bell to max Combo, drop the bell and hit it with Tempest Flurry"), L("Wind Dancer, Herald of Ash e Ghost Dance sempre ligados", "Wind Dancer, Herald of Ash and Ghost Dance always on")],
  gems=[
   G("Storm Wave", ["Lightning Attunement", "Elemental Armament II", "Branching Fissures II", "Rapid Attacks II", "Deliberation"], L("Limpar mapa", "Clearing maps"), L("Branching Fissures II (tier 5) e Rapid Attacks II (tier 4); Deliberation troca lentidão por dano (Rigwald's Ferocity é a alternativa).", "Branching Fissures II (tier 5) and Rapid Attacks II (tier 4); Deliberation trades slowness for damage (Rigwald's Ferocity is the alternative)."), "free"),
   G("Tempest Flurry", ["Rapid Attacks II", "Rage III", "Lightning Attunement", "Elemental Armament II"], L("Boss", "Boss"), L("SÓ contra boss (o autor).", "ONLY against bosses (the author)."), "free"),
   G("Tempest Bell", ["Ancestral Call II", "Mana Leech", "Concentrated Area", "Heft"], L("Boss", "Boss"), L("SÓ contra boss: Ancestral Call II e Heft dão o golpe forte no sino; Mana Leech ajuda a mana.", "ONLY against bosses: Ancestral Call II and Heft make the big hit on the bell; Mana Leech helps mana."), "free"),
   G("Wind Dancer", ["Magnified Area I", "Maim"], L("Defesa e empurrão", "Defence and knockback"), L("Tier 4, 30 Spirit. Acumula stages de Evasion; ao ser atingido gasta todos para causar dano e empurrar.", "Tier 4, 30 Spirit. Builds Evasion stages; when hit it spends them all to deal damage and knock back."), "core", 1, SP30),
   G("Herald of Ash", ["Magnified Area II"], L("Explosão de fogo", "Fire explosion"), L("30 Spirit; Magnified Area II para mais área.", "30 Spirit; Magnified Area II for more area."), "core", 2, SP30),
   G("Ghost Dance", ["Compressed Duration I"], L("Recuperar ES ao ser atingido", "Recover ES when hit"), L("Tier 4, 30 Spirit. Você ganha Ghost Shrouds periodicamente; ao ser atingido com um deles, recupera Energy Shield conforme a Evasion.", "Tier 4, 30 Spirit. You periodically gain Ghost Shrouds; when hit with one, you recover Energy Shield based on your Evasion."), "core", 3, SP30),
  ],
  cheap=["Sleek Jacket", "Opulent Gloves", "Sekhema Sandals", "Amber Amulet", "Sapphire Ring", "Ruby Ring", "Shavronne's Satchel"],
  full=["Sleek Jacket", "Ancestral Tiara", "Opulent Gloves", "Sekhema Sandals", "Amber Amulet", "Shavronne's Satchel", "Ngamahu's Chosen"],
  stats=[L("Energy Shield (barra)", "Energy Shield (the bar)"), L("Evasion (velocidade)", "Evasion (speed)"), L("Crítico", "Crit")],
  tree=L("Pontos 89–105: Chaos Inoculation (vida máxima 1, imune a caos), Melding (+40% de ES máximo), First Principle of the Hollow (+20% de Evasion e de ES), For the Jugular e Heartbreaking (+25% de dano crítico cada), Deadly Force (+15% de chance de crítico e +15% de dano depois de um crítico), Heartstopping e True Strike (+20% de chance de crítico cada) e Critical Exploit. Saem alguns nós de dano elemental e de área da fase anterior (parte do respec).",
         "Points 89–105: Chaos Inoculation (maximum life 1, chaos immune), Melding (+40% maximum ES), First Principle of the Hollow (+20% Evasion and ES), For the Jugular and Heartbreaking (+25% crit damage each), Deadly Force (+15% crit chance and +15% damage after a crit), Heartstopping and True Strike (+20% crit chance each) and Critical Exploit. Some elemental and area damage nodes from the previous phase leave (part of the respec)."),
  avoid=[L("Fazer a troca para ES com o corpo abaixo de ~1400 Evasion e ~500 ES: sem eles o Chaos Inoculation te deixa frágil", "Making the ES switch with a body below ~1400 Evasion and ~500 ES: without them Chaos Inoculation leaves you fragile"), L("Ficar com Herald of Thunder e Lingering Illusion ligados: o Spirit (90 de 100) já está gasto com Wind Dancer, Herald of Ash e Ghost Dance", "Keeping Herald of Thunder and Lingering Illusion on: Spirit (90 of 100) is already spent on Wind Dancer, Herald of Ash and Ghost Dance")],
  exit=[L("4º Trial (~80): Hollow Resonance Technique (ver Ascendência)", "4th Trial (~80): Hollow Resonance Technique (see Ascendancy)"), L("Trocar para o Normal Endgame quando tiver a currency dos itens (a troca é do autor)", "Swap to Normal Endgame when you have the currency for the items (the author's swap)")]),

 dict(id="endgame", name=L("Endgame 90+", "Endgame 90+"), lv=[90, 95], tag=L("Hyper Speed de verdade: Hollow Focus, Power Charges e Falling Thunder", "The real Hyper Speed: Hollow Focus, Power Charges and Falling Thunder"),
  carry=L("Você: Tempest Flurry + Staggering Palm (Falling Thunder no Set 2)", "You: Tempest Flurry + Staggering Palm (Falling Thunder in Set 2)"), dmgSplit=[100, 0],
  goal=L("A variante Normal Endgame do autor: 'Hyper Speed sem gems caras, só uma para a velocidade'. Tempest Flurry voa pelo mapa (12 a 18 ataques por segundo) e o Staggering Palm limpa com projéteis. O Hollow Focus (da ascendência) faz sinos aparecerem por perto: bater neles dá golpes críticos garantidos e cria ondas de choque. Com Living Lightning II + Culmination II + Ailith's Chimes no Hollow Focus (NESSA ORDEM) você gera Power Charges para o Charged Staff (limpeza) e para o Falling Thunder (matar boss e Rare: use SÓ com todas as 5 cargas). Weapon Set 1 = todas as skills, sem arma; Weapon Set 2 = só o Falling Thunder, com um Sinister Quarterstaff. Mantenha o Herald of Ash no nível 4 e o Tempest Flurry no 5; suba o resto das gems o máximo que der. Mana: Oisín's Oath no Hollow Focus + Leech Physical as Mana em um dos anéis (um anel precisa ter isso); Efficiency II e o Tempest Flurry no nível 5 ajudam. Requisitos de atributo das gems (do autor): Str 35, Dex 90, Int 70.",
         "The author's Normal Endgame variant: 'Hyper Speed without expensive gems except one for speed'. Tempest Flurry flies through the map (12 to 18 attacks per second) and Staggering Palm clears with projectiles. Hollow Focus (from the ascendancy) makes bells appear around you: hitting them gives guaranteed critical hits and creates shockwaves. With Living Lightning II + Culmination II + Ailith's Chimes on Hollow Focus (IN THAT ORDER) you generate Power Charges for Charged Staff (clearing) and for Falling Thunder (killing bosses and Rares: use it ONLY with all 5 charges). Weapon Set 1 = all skills, no weapon; Weapon Set 2 = only Falling Thunder, with a Sinister Quarterstaff. Keep Herald of Ash at level 4 and Tempest Flurry at 5; level the rest of the gems as high as you can. Mana: Oisín's Oath on Hollow Focus + Leech Physical as Mana on one of your rings (one ring must have it); Efficiency II and Tempest Flurry at level 5 help. The gems' attribute requirements (author's): Str 35, Dex 90, Int 70."),
  rotation=[L("Tempest Flurry para andar e bater; segure o Staggering Palm no pack", "Tempest Flurry to move and hit; hold Staggering Palm on packs"), L("Staggering Palm nos sinos do Hollow Focus algumas vezes a cada 30 s (mantém o buff de projéteis)", "Staggering Palm on Hollow Focus's bells a few times every 30 s (keeps the projectile buff)"), L("Boss/Rare que não derrete: bata algumas vezes (Daze e Blind), espere as 5 cargas e solte o Falling Thunder (Set 2)", "Boss/Rare that isn't melting: hit a few times (Daze and Blind), wait for 5 charges and release Falling Thunder (Set 2)")],
  gems=[
   G("Hollow Focus", ["Cooldown Recovery II", "Oisin's Oath", "Living Lightning II", "Culmination II", "Ailith's Chimes"], L("Sinos e Power Charges", "Bells and Power Charges"), L("Vem da ascendência (Hollow Focus Technique). Sinos etéreos aparecem perto de você; seus golpes os destroem criando ondas de choque e Heavy Stun em quem está Primed for Stun; acertos neles são sempre críticos. Nível 20. Os cinco suportes vão NESSA ORDEM: é assim que a combinação de Combo funciona.", "From the ascendancy (Hollow Focus Technique). Ethereal bells appear near you; your hits destroy them creating shockwaves and Heavy Stun on enemies Primed for Stun; hits on them are always critical. Level 20. The five supports go IN THAT ORDER: that's how the Combo interaction works."), "free"),
   G("Hollow Resonance", ["Magnified Area II", "Blind II", "Elemental Armament II", "Close Combat II", "Culling Strike II"], L("Sino nas costas", "Bell on your back"), L("Vem da ascendência (Hollow Resonance Technique). Prende um sino etéreo nas suas costas; críticos com outras skills o fazem tocar, causando dano em volta. Nível 20.", "From the ascendancy (Hollow Resonance Technique). Attaches an ethereal bell to your back; crits with other skills make it ring out, damaging nearby enemies. Level 20."), "free"),
   G("Trinity", [], L("Elementos", "Elements"), L("Tier 14, 100 Spirit (o autor diz que o Absent Amulet já traz o Trinity). Fogo, Gelo e Raio: o dano elemental cresce com a Afinidade acumulada.", "Tier 14, 100 Spirit (the author says the Absent Amulet already brings Trinity). Fire, Cold and Lightning: elemental damage grows with the Affinity you build."), "core", 4, L("100 Spirit", "100 Spirit")),
   G("Charged Staff", ["Prolonged Duration II", "Culling Strike II", "Innervate", "Embitter", "Blazing Critical"], L("Limpeza com cargas", "Clearing with charges"), L("Nível 18. Consome as cargas: dano de raio e uma onda de choque nos seus ataques.", "Level 18. Consumes charges: lightning damage and a shockwave on your attacks."), "free"),
   G("Falling Thunder", ["Pinpoint Critical", "Elemental Armament II", "Blindside", "Elemental Focus", "Lightning Penetration"], L("Boss e Rare (Set 2)", "Bosses and Rares (Set 2)"), L("Nível 19, Weapon Set 2 com o Sinister Quarterstaff. Golpeia o chão num cone grande e gasta as cargas para disparar projéteis de raio. Use SÓ com as 5 cargas, com 83%+ de chance de crítico (Pinpoint Critical) e depois de bater no boss algumas vezes para Dazar e Cegar.", "Level 19, Weapon Set 2 with the Sinister Quarterstaff. Slams the ground in a large cone and spends charges to fire lightning projectiles. Use ONLY with 5 charges, with 83%+ crit chance (Pinpoint Critical) and after hitting the boss a few times to Daze and Blind it."), "free"),
   G("Killing Palm", ["Thrill of the Kill", "Charge Profusion II", "Rage III", "Blazing Critical"], L("Cargas no boss", "Charges on bosses"), L("Nível 12. Avança sobre o inimigo e executa (Cull) se a vida estiver baixa; cada morte dá um Power Charge. No boss, use nos sinos do Hollow Focus antes da luta para começar com as cargas cheias.", "Level 12. Dashes to an enemy and Culls it if its life is low; each kill grants a Power Charge. On bosses, use it on Hollow Focus's bells before the fight to start with full charges."), "free"),
   G("Herald of Ash", ["Magnified Area II"], L("Explosão de fogo", "Fire explosion"), L("Nível 4 (o autor manda manter no 4). 30 Spirit.", "Level 4 (the author says keep it at 4). 30 Spirit."), "core", 1, SP30),
   G("Wind Dancer", ["Blind II", "Maim", "Magnified Area II"], L("Defesa e empurrão", "Defence and knockback"), L("Nível 15. 30 Spirit.", "Level 15. 30 Spirit."), "core", 2, SP30),
   G("Tempest Flurry", ["Crescendo II", "Rapid Attacks III", "Efficiency II", "Medved's Felling", "Rigwald's Ferocity"], L("A skill que voa", "The skill that flies"), L("Nível 5 (o autor manda manter no 5: menos custo de mana). Crescendo II usa o Final Strike duas vezes; Rapid Attacks III, Medved's Felling e Rigwald's Ferocity puxam a velocidade (a variante Normal do autor só tem uma gem cara, a da velocidade).", "Level 5 (the author says keep it at 5: lower mana cost). Crescendo II uses the Final Strike twice; Rapid Attacks III, Medved's Felling and Rigwald's Ferocity drive the speed (the author's Normal variant has only one expensive gem, the speed one)."), "free"),
   G("Staggering Palm", ["Elemental Armament II", "Execute II", "Pinpoint Critical", "Multishot II", "Retreat II"], L("Limpeza com projéteis", "Clearing with projectiles"), L("Nível 20. Avança e dá Heavy Stun em alvos Primed for Stun, golpeando outros alvos em sequência; o Heavy Stun dá um buff que faz seus ataques de cajado dispararem projéteis. Use nos sinos algumas vezes a cada 30 s e olhe o canto esquerdo para ver o buff.", "Level 20. Dashes and Heavy Stuns Primed for Stun targets, striking others in sequence; the Heavy Stun grants a buff that makes your quarterstaff attacks fire projectiles. Use it on bells a few times every 30 s and check the left corner for the buff."), "free"),
   G("Ghost Dance", ["Cooldown Recovery II", "Clarity I"], L("Recuperar ES ao ser atingido", "Recover ES when hit"), L("Nível 18. 30 Spirit.", "Level 18. 30 Spirit."), "core", 3, SP30),
  ],
  cheap=["Sleek Jacket", "Opulent Gloves", "Sekhema Sandals", "Amber Amulet", "Shavronne's Satchel"],
  full=["Sleek Jacket", "Ancestral Tiara", "Kalandra's Touch", "Shavronne's Satchel", "Lavianga's Spirits", "The Fall of the Axe", "Nascent Hope", "For Utopia"],
  stats=[L("Velocidade de ataque (Evasion)", "Attack speed (Evasion)"), L("Energy Shield (6.000+)", "Energy Shield (6,000+)"), L("Dano adicionado nas luvas e nos anéis", "Added damage on gloves and rings")],
  tree=L("108 pontos (Normal Endgame) mais 18 e 17 nos Weapon Sets: Hollow Palm Technique, Chaos Inoculation, Martial Artistry, Overflowing Power (+2 Power Charges máximas: com ele você chega às 5 cargas), Imbibed Power (+25% de dano durante um flask), Chakra of Impact e Throatseeker (+60% de dano crítico, −20% de chance de crítico). Set 1: Sharp Sight, Deep Trance, Agile Succession, Chakra of Rhythm e Chakra of Thought; Set 2: Careful Assassin, One with the Storm, Moment of Truth, Martial Artistry e True Strike.",
         "108 points (Normal Endgame) plus 18 and 17 on the Weapon Sets: Hollow Palm Technique, Chaos Inoculation, Martial Artistry, Overflowing Power (+2 maximum Power Charges: with it you reach the 5 charges), Imbibed Power (+25% damage during a flask), Chakra of Impact and Throatseeker (+60% crit damage, −20% crit chance). Set 1: Sharp Sight, Deep Trance, Agile Succession, Chakra of Rhythm and Chakra of Thought; Set 2: Careful Assassin, One with the Storm, Moment of Truth, Martial Artistry and True Strike."),
  avoid=[L("Aceitar 'projétil extra' nas luvas como prioridade: o autor quer dois danos adicionados de tier alto", "Prioritising 'extra projectile' on the gloves: the author wants two high-tier added damage mods"), L("Trocar a ORDEM dos suportes do Hollow Focus", "Changing the ORDER of Hollow Focus's supports"), L("Soltar o Falling Thunder sem as 5 cargas", "Releasing Falling Thunder without 5 charges")],
  exit=[L("Se você não está gerando cargas, coloque dano de raio flat no anel ou na arma (dispara o Living Lightning II)", "If you're not generating charges, put flat lightning damage on your ring or weapon (it triggers Living Lightning II)"), L("Final Endgame quando o item caro chegar (Mageblood, Rite of Passage)", "Final Endgame when the expensive items arrive (Mageblood, Rite of Passage)")]),

 dict(id="max", name=L("Endgame final", "Final endgame"), lv=[96, 100], tag=L("Final Endgame: a versão mais forte (e cara)", "Final Endgame: the strongest (and priciest) version"),
  carry=L("Você: Tempest Flurry + Staggering Palm (Falling Thunder no Set 2)", "You: Tempest Flurry + Staggering Palm (Falling Thunder in Set 2)"), dmgSplit=[100, 0],
  goal=L("A variante Final Endgame do autor: 'a versão mais forte de todas, cara, o topo da build; só troque para ela quando tiver currency para bons itens'. A engrenagem é a mesma do Normal Endgame, com peças de luxo: Mageblood no cinto, Rite of Passage entre os charms, Kamasan Tiara no capacete e um Refined Breach Ring. Nas gems: o Falling Thunder chega ao nível 20 com Rakiata's Flow e Volt, o Staggering Palm ganha Garukhan's Resolve, o Killing Palm troca para Thrill of the Kill II e o Tempest Flurry soma Rage III. O Hollow Resonance sai da barra. No Mageblood, o autor procura Silver, Stibnite, Jade e Sulphur: de preferência um duplicado e três de cada tipo. Joias: Heart of the Well com dano extra x2 e dano crítico, Time-Lost Jewels e, na última, uma Sapphire com 50% de ES. Para encontros muito difíceis (principalmente Simulacrum) o autor sugere Blasphemy com Temporal Chains e/ou Enfeeble: desligue o Elemental Conflux e o Ghost Dance para caber no Spirit.",
         "The author's Final Endgame variant: 'the strongest version of all, expensive, the pinnacle of the build; only switch to it when you have currency for good items'. The engine is the same as Normal Endgame, with luxury pieces: Mageblood on the belt, Rite of Passage among the charms, a Kamasan Tiara helmet and a Refined Breach Ring. On the gems: Falling Thunder reaches level 20 with Rakiata's Flow and Volt, Staggering Palm gains Garukhan's Resolve, Killing Palm swaps to Thrill of the Kill II and Tempest Flurry adds Rage III. Hollow Resonance leaves the bar. On the Mageblood the author looks for Silver, Stibnite, Jade and Sulphur: ideally one duplicate and three unique ones. Jewels: Heart of the Well with x2 extra damage and crit damage, Time-Lost Jewels and, for the last one, a Sapphire with 50% ES. For very hard encounters (mostly Simulacrum) the author suggests Blasphemy with Temporal Chains and/or Enfeeble: turn off Elemental Conflux and Ghost Dance to fit the Spirit."),
  rotation=[L("Igual ao Endgame", "Same as Endgame")],
  gems=[
   G("Hollow Focus", ["Cooldown Recovery II", "Oisin's Oath", "Living Lightning II", "Culmination II", "Ailith's Chimes"], L("Sinos e Power Charges", "Bells and Power Charges"), L("Igual ao Endgame; a mesma ordem.", "Same as Endgame; same order."), "free"),
   G("Trinity", [], L("Elementos", "Elements"), L("100 Spirit.", "100 Spirit."), "core", 4, L("100 Spirit", "100 Spirit")),
   G("Ghost Dance", ["Cooldown Recovery II", "Clarity I"], L("Recuperar ES ao ser atingido", "Recover ES when hit"), L("30 Spirit.", "30 Spirit."), "core", 3, SP30),
   G("Charged Staff", ["Prolonged Duration II", "Culling Strike II", "Innervate", "Embitter", "Blazing Critical"], L("Limpeza com cargas", "Clearing with charges"), L("Sem mudança.", "No change."), "free"),
   G("Killing Palm", ["Thrill of the Kill II", "Charge Profusion II", "Blazing Critical", "Rage III"], L("Cargas no boss", "Charges on bosses"), L("Thrill of the Kill II (tier 3): além do dano de raio, mais chance de Chocar.", "Thrill of the Kill II (tier 3): besides the lightning damage, more Shock chance."), "free"),
   G("Herald of Ash", ["Magnified Area II"], L("Explosão de fogo", "Fire explosion"), L("Nível 4. 30 Spirit.", "Level 4. 30 Spirit."), "core", 1, SP30),
   G("Tempest Flurry", ["Crescendo II", "Rapid Attacks III", "Efficiency II", "Medved's Felling", "Rigwald's Ferocity", "Rage III"], L("A skill que voa", "The skill that flies"), L("Soma Rage III (seis suportes).", "Adds Rage III (six supports)."), "free"),
   G("Falling Thunder", ["Pinpoint Critical", "Elemental Armament II", "Elemental Focus", "Rakiata's Flow", "Volt"], L("Boss e Rare (Set 2)", "Bosses and Rares (Set 2)"), L("Nível 20. Rakiata's Flow inverte as resistências do inimigo e o Volt junta Voltaic Charge enquanto você anda.", "Level 20. Rakiata's Flow inverts the enemy's resistances and Volt gathers Voltaic Charge while you move."), "free"),
   G("Staggering Palm", ["Elemental Armament II", "Execute II", "Garukhan's Resolve", "Multishot II", "Retreat II"], L("Limpeza com projéteis", "Clearing with projectiles"), L("Garukhan's Resolve no lugar do Pinpoint Critical.", "Garukhan's Resolve in place of Pinpoint Critical."), "free"),
   G("Wind Dancer", ["Blind II", "Maim"], L("Defesa e empurrão", "Defence and knockback"), L("Nível 15. 30 Spirit.", "Level 15. 30 Spirit."), "core", 2, SP30),
  ],
  cheap=[L("Igual ao Endgame", "Same as Endgame")], full=["Mageblood", "Rite of Passage", "Kamasan Tiara", "Kalandra's Touch"],
  stats=[L("Velocidade de ataque", "Attack speed"), L("Energy Shield", "Energy Shield"), L("Dano crítico", "Crit damage")],
  tree=L("Os mesmos 108 pontos do Normal Endgame, com os Weapon Sets um pouco diferentes: Set 1 = Sharp Sight, Deep Trance, Chakra of Rhythm, Chakra of Thought e Agile Succession; Set 2 = True Strike, One with the Storm, Careful Assassin, For the Jugular, Martial Artistry e Throatseeker.",
         "The same 108 points as Normal Endgame, with slightly different Weapon Sets: Set 1 = Sharp Sight, Deep Trance, Chakra of Rhythm, Chakra of Thought and Agile Succession; Set 2 = True Strike, One with the Storm, Careful Assassin, For the Jugular, Martial Artistry and Throatseeker."),
  avoid=[L("Trocar para o Final Endgame sem os itens: o autor diz para só fazer quando houver currency", "Switching to Final Endgame without the items: the author says only do it once you have the currency"), L("Gastar Divines antes de fechar resistência e Spirit", "Spending Divines before resistances and Spirit are closed")], exit=[]),
